3.5 SAS 예제

Example: Colon data

time: days until event or censoring
status: censoring status
rx: treatment; Obs(ervation), Lev(amisole), Lev(amisole_5-FU)
sex: 1=male, 0:female
differ: differentiation of tumour (1=well, 2=moderate, 3=poor)



